Hello {{supplier_name}},

ReloPass is a relocation platform used by companies to manage employee moves. A company on our platform is requesting a quote for the following services: {{service_labels}}.

Reference: {{rfq_ref}}
Respond by: {{respond_by}}

MOVE BRIEF

{{brief_rows}}

WHAT WE NEED FROM YOU

1. Confirm that you cover this route and are available around the target move date.
2. Provide your total price. An itemised breakdown is helpful but not required.
3. State how long your quote will remain valid.
4. Flag anything missing or unclear in the brief so we can follow up.

No account is needed. Your link is private and expires in {{link_expires_days}} days. One submission is allowed per link. After you submit, the company will review all received quotes and be in touch if they decide to proceed.

Submit your quote: {{magic_link}}

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass

Hello {{supplier_name}},

This is a reminder that a quote request is still open and waiting for your response.

Reference: {{rfq_ref}}
Route: {{move_from}} to {{move_to}}
Respond by: {{respond_by}}
Days remaining: {{reminder_days_left}}

Your link is private and expires in {{link_expires_days}} days. One submission is allowed per link.

Submit your quote: {{magic_link}}

If you cannot quote for this request, no action is needed. The request will close automatically after the deadline.

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass

Hello {{supplier_name}},

We have received your quote for reference {{rfq_ref}}.

WHAT WE RECEIVED

Total: {{quote_total}} {{quote_currency}}
Valid until: {{quote_valid_until}}

ITEMISED LINES

{{quote_lines}}

WHAT HAPPENS NEXT

The company will review all received quotes and make a selection. If they choose your quote, we will notify you and the company will be in touch to discuss next steps.

No further action is needed from you at this stage.

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass

Hello {{employee_first_name}},

Your relocation quote request has been sent.

Reference: {{rfq_ref}}
Services: {{service_labels}}
Suppliers contacted: {{recipients_count}}
Respond by: {{respond_by}}

SUPPLIERS CONTACTED

{{contacted_supplier_names}}

SERVICES NOT COVERED

The following services could not be routed to a supplier at this time:

{{not_contacted}}

Quotes will appear in your dashboard as they arrive. You will receive an email each time one is submitted. If any uncovered services need attention, speak with your HR contact.

Track your quotes: {{employee_rfq_url}}

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass

Hello {{employee_first_name}},

{{supplier_name}} has submitted a quote for your move.

Reference: {{rfq_ref}}
Supplier: {{supplier_name}}
Total: {{quote_total}} {{quote_currency}}
Valid until: {{quote_valid_until}}
Quotes received so far: {{quotes_received_count}} of {{recipients_count}}

You can view and compare all received quotes in your dashboard. If you have a preference, you can flag it there for your HR team to review.

View your quotes: {{employee_quotes_url}}

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass

Hello {{employee_first_name}},

Your HR team has approved a quote for your upcoming move.

Reference: {{rfq_ref}}
Selected supplier: {{validated_supplier_name}}
Approved amount: {{quote_total}} {{quote_currency}}

WHAT HAPPENS NEXT

Your HR team or the supplier will be in touch with you directly to confirm arrangements. You do not need to pay anything yourself at this stage unless your HR team tells you otherwise.

If you have questions about next steps, contact your HR team directly or reach us at {{support_email}}.

ReloPass

Hello {{hr_first_name}},

Quotes are ready for review for {{employee_full_name}}'s relocation.

Reference: {{rfq_ref}}
Quotes received: {{quotes_received_count}} of {{recipients_count}}

Open the validation screen to compare quotes side by side. Once you validate one, the selected supplier will be notified, all other quotes will be closed, and {{employee_first_name}} will be informed.

Review and validate: {{hr_rfq_url}}

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass

Hello {{hr_first_name}},

The deadline for {{rfq_ref}} has passed and no quotes were received.

Employee: {{employee_full_name}}
Services: {{service_labels}}
Deadline passed: {{respond_by}}

WHAT YOU CAN DO

1. Re-send the RFQ to the same suppliers with an extended deadline.
2. Add new suppliers from the approved list and send a fresh RFQ.
3. Contact the suppliers directly to ask whether they intend to respond.

Open the RFQ to take action: {{hr_rfq_url}}

For questions: {{support_email}}

ReloPass
